title: Rebuilding a District
subtitle: One district has lost many of its members.
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and sys_rebuild_timer <= 0 and sys_any_loss = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.sys_rebuild_timer = 4;
Q.month_actions += 1;
RG.target('loss');
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= Rebuilding a District

The party in **[+ sys_target_name +]** is a shadow of what it was: [+ sys_target_members +] thousand members, where there used to be many more. The district office is open two evenings a week. [? if sys_target_repression >= 60 : The police are the main reason. ?][? if sys_target_repression < 60 : Defeats, quarrels and unemployment have done the rest. ?]

- @organisers: Send organisers from the Zentrale.
- @gates: Recruit at the factory gates.
- @paper: Start a district paper.
- @easy_discard

@organisers
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Members come back, and the district looks to the Zentrale.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.district(Q.sys_target, {members: 0.12, loyalty: 6});
Q['lean_' + Q.leading_faction] += 1;
!}

Three organisers from Berlin rent rooms in [+ sys_target_name +] and visit every member who has stopped paying dues. Many start again.

@gates
subtitle: New members from the works, if the workers are angry enough.
choose-if: sys_target_militancy >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: The workers of [+ sys_target_name +] are in no mood to join anything.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.sys_target, {members: 0.07, militancy: 3});
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 2;
!}

At every shift change, our people are at the gates with leaflets and membership cards. The young workers sign.

@paper
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. A paper builds support slowly, and members follow.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.worker_support += 2;
RG.district(Q.sys_target, {members: 0.04, militancy: 2});
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 2;
!}

The district gets its own weekly paper, four pages, with the local news the bourgeois papers will not print: the accident at the pit, the foreman who hits apprentices, the price of coal.
